    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game you need to help the ball save his girlfriend. Go on a round-the-world trip. Move, jumo, overcome obstacles and solve puzzles. Collect as many stars as possible. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After purchasing you will receive: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- An exciting adventure: Travel through colorful worlds filled with dangers and surprises in order to save your beloved. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Exciting gameplay: Dynamic and exciting gameplay based on physics. You will find many challenges that require precision, reaction and strategic thinking. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 15 unique levels: Diverse and carefully designed levels, each of which offers new mechanics, obstacles and puzzles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- High-quality visual design: Pleasant graphics and stylish design that create an atmosphere of adventure. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A great way to pass the time: An exciting way to escape from everyday worries and have an interesting time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Satisfaction from passing difficult sections and completing each level. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- unforgettable impressions: Vivid emotions and memories that will remain after completing the game.</p>",
